## T2001 -- money of one currency where another is declared.
## command: lume check   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; T2001_money_currency.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: convert, or declare the same currency
fn total(a: money[BRL], b: money[USD]) -> money[BRL] = a + b
print 0
